## 7) Коммит (один, чистый)

Сообщение (пример):

```
fix(audio): make web micro-flac ogg page aware + allow 32-bit sources

- For web FLAC (micro-flac path) detect Ogg page total size and wait/grow block to avoid silent NEED_MORE loops
- Allow 32-bit source FLAC in web mode (downconvert to 16-bit output)
- No changes to SD mode or other web codecs
```

